---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="For Institutions"
  description="How Castalia programs can be adopted by universities, schools, and workforce partners."
>
  <main class="programs-page section">
    <div class="section__intro">
      <h1>For institutions</h1>
      <p>
        Use this section to explain how institutions evaluate, pilot, and deploy programs from the
        catalog.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid--cards">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Deployment model</h3>
        <p>Document whether courses ship as LMS packages, hosted experiences, or hybrid delivery.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Commercial model</h3>
        <p>Clarify licensing, cohort pricing, revenue share, or minimum-seat structures.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Support model</h3>
        <p>Explain faculty onboarding, technical support, and assessment or reporting options.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
